WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,020
If it's hot, it's hot. Who doesn't have a bell?

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,740
The most important thing now is food

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,740
But the fire can't start

4
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,780
I can't get anything to eat.

5
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:12,050
I'm so hungry

6
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:14,430
I want to eat roasted sweet potatoes

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,180
If Lin Feng were here

8
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:20,120
Her building is dry, warm and has a fire. Shut up.

9
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,680
You miss her now and drove her away in the first place

10
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:23,760
Which of you didn't raise your hand?

11
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:29,580
Weren't you the one who took the lead? Lin Shiyan, please say it again

12
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,540
Isn’t what I said true?

13
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:33,470
The vote was initiated by you

14
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,190
You instigated the eviction

15
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:36,780
I can't hold it anymore now

16
00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:37,700
Who are you yelling at?

17
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:40,800
Yes, I rushed it

18
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,360
But what's the use of saying this now?

19
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:49,700
Will she be able to come back? Weiwei, please stop arguing, Chen Yao, Chen Yao, Chen Yao, no, the fever is getting worse.

20
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,340
If this continues, something will happen to people

21
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:55,060
This rain won't stop for a while

22
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,700
What little land they have

23
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:05,190
I'm afraid it'll all get soaked next time

24
00:01:05,470 --> 00:01:06,510
There's something good to watch
